      "title": "France to deploy military forces during expected weekend protests – Europe live",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/live/2026/oct/20/france-protests-paris-curfews-italy-europe-ukraine-latest-news-updates",
      "description": "<p>Interior minister confirms military to reinforce police as Italy poised to approve tougher security measures in response to protests</p><p><em>Nordic correspondent</em></p><p>As well as <strong>Steve Witkoff,</strong> Ukrainian president <strong>Volodymyr Zelenskyy</strong> will also meet the Norwegian prime minister, <strong>Jonas Gahr Støre</strong> and the Finnish president <strong>Alexander Stubb</strong> and Norway’s new <strong>King Haakon</strong> during his visit to Oslo.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/live/2026/oct/20/france-protests-paris-curfews-italy-europe-ukraine-latest-news-updates\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
